{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"high-contrast-light","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"High Contrast Light","description":"Black on white with dark, saturated colors that meet the WCAG AAA ratio.","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Themes"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"themes":[{"label":"High Contrast Light","path":"themes/high-contrast-light.json","uiTheme":"light"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"themes/high-contrast-light.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"name\": \"High Contrast Light\",\n  \"type\": \"light\",\n  \"colors\": {\n    \"editor.background\": \"#ffffff\",\n    \"editor.foreground\": \"#000000\",\n    \"sideBar.background\": \"#ffffff\",\n    \"activityBar.background\": \"#ffffff\",\n    \"titleBar.activeBackground\": \"#ffffff\",\n    \"tab.inactiveBackground\": \"#f2f2f2\",\n    \"list.hoverBackground\": \"#e5e5e5\",\n    \"list.activeSelectionBackground\": \"#add6ff\",\n    \"input.background\": \"#ffffff\",\n    \"editorWidget.background\": \"#ffffff\",\n    \"panel.border\": \"#0f4a85\",\n    \"focusBorder\": \"#0f4a85\",\n    \"button.background\": \"#0f4a85\",\n    \"textLink.foreground\": \"#0f4a85\",\n    \"editor.selectionBackground\": \"#add6ff\",\n    \"editor.lineHighlightBackground\": \"#e5e5e580\",\n    \"editorCursor.foreground\": \"#0f4a85\",\n    \"editorIndentGuide.background\": \"#0f4a85\",\n    \"errorForeground\": \"#a31515\",\n    \"gitDecoration.addedResourceForeground\": \"#096d48\",\n    \"gitDecoration.modifiedResourceForeground\": \"#895503\",\n    \"gitDecoration.deletedResourceForeground\": \"#a31515\"\n  },\n  \"tokenColors\": [\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"comment\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#515151\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"string\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#0f4a85\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.numeric\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#096d48\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"keyword\",\n        \"storage\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#0000ff\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.type\",\n        \"support.type\",\n        \"storage.type\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#185e73\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function\",\n        \"support.function\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#5e2cbc\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.language\",\n        \"constant\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#0070c1\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"variable.other.property\",\n        \"support.type.property-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#001080\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.tag\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#0000ff\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.other.attribute-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#001080\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function.macro\",\n        \"meta.preprocessor\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#a31515\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# High Contrast Light\n\nBlack on white with dark, saturated colors that meet the WCAG AAA ratio.\n\nInstall it, then pick **High Contrast Light** in **Settings > Colour theme**. It is a light theme.\n\nAn original palette by Vyloxi, designed for accessibility.\n\n| Role | Color |\n| --- | --- |\n| Background | `#ffffff` |\n| Text | `#000000` |\n| Accent | `#0f4a85` |\n| Keywords | `#0000ff` |\n| Strings | `#0f4a85` |\n| Functions | `#5e2cbc` |\n| Types | `#185e73` |\n| Comments | `#515151` |\n\nThis extension is only a theme: it runs no code and asks for no permissions.\n"}}}